== B. The threshold ==
The datasheet gives:

{{{#!latex
V_{\text{fall}} = 2.5\left(1+\frac{R_{\text{A2}}}{R_{\text{A1}}}\right)
}}}

{{{#!latex
V_{\text{rise}} = 2.5\left(1+\frac{R_{\text{A2}}+R_{\text{B1}}} {R_{\text{A1}}}\right)
}}}

The first is the falling threshold; the second is the rising one, with a sum of about 13 kOhm.

